<h2 id="풀이">풀이</h2>

<div class="language-sql highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">SELECT</span> <span class="n">O</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">ANIMAL_ID</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">O</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">ANIMAL_TYPE</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">O</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">NAME</span>
<span class="k">FROM</span> <span class="n">ANIMAL_OUTS</span> <span class="n">O</span>
<span class="k">RIGHT</span> <span class="k">OUTER</span> <span class="k">JOIN</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="k">SELECT</span> <span class="o">*</span> 
                  <span class="k">FROM</span> <span class="n">ANIMAL_INS</span> 
                  <span class="k">WHERE</span> <span class="n">SEX_UPON_INTAKE</span> <span class="k">NOT</span> <span class="k">LIKE</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="s1">'%Spayed%'</span><span class="p">))</span> <span class="n">I</span>
<span class="k">ON</span> <span class="n">O</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">ANIMAL_ID</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">I</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">ANIMAL_ID</span>
<span class="k">WHERE</span> <span class="n">SEX_UPON_OUTCOME</span> <span class="o">!=</span> <span class="n">SEX_UPON_INTAKE</span>
<span class="k">ORDER</span> <span class="k">BY</span> <span class="n">O</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">ANIMAL_ID</span> <span class="k">ASC</span><span class="p">;</span>
</code></pre></div></div>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="MySQL" /><category term="SQL" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[문제 설명]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 체육복</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/27/python_ct1.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 체육복" /><published>2021-12-27T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2021-12-27T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/27/python_ct1</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/27/python_ct1.html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-27-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이">풀이(</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">lost</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">reserve</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="n">set_r</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nf">set</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">reserve</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nf">set</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">lost</span><span class="p">)</span>
    <span class="n">set_l</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nf">set</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">lost</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nf">set</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">reserve</span><span class="p">)</span>
    
    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="n">set_r</span><span class="p">:</span>
        <span class="k">if</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="n">set_l</span><span class="p">:</span>
            <span class="n">set_l</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">remove</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">)</span>
        <span class="k">elif</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="mi">1</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="n">set_l</span><span class="p">:</span>
            <span class="n">set_l</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">remove</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">)</span>
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">n</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">set_l</span><span class="p">)</span>
</code></pre></div></div>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 자릿수 더하기</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/26/python_ct1.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 자릿수 더하기" /><published>2021-12-26T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2021-12-26T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/26/python_ct1</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/26/python_ct1.html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-26-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이">풀이(</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="p">):</span>

    <span class="n">answer</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nf">list</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nf">map</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">int</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="nf">str</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n</span><span class="p">)))</span>

    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="nf">sum</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">answer</span><span class="p">)</span>
</code></pre></div></div>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 핸드폰 번호 가리기</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/25/python_ct1.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 핸드폰 번호 가리기" /><published>2021-12-25T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2021-12-25T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/25/python_ct1</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/25/python_ct1.html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-25-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이실패">풀이(실패)</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">):</span>
    
    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="nf">range</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">4</span><span class="p">):</span>
        <span class="n">phone_number</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">replace</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">],</span> <span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">*</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">)</span>
    
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">phone_number</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<ol>
  <li>실행결과 9번만 맞고 다른 결과는 실패로 나왔습니다. 찾아보니 9번 케이스는 문자열 길이가 4인 경우라고 하네요. 실행 전 테스트 케이스는 다 통과했었는데 실패하는 이유가 뭘까요?</li>
</ol>

<h2 id="풀이성공">풀이(성공)</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">*</span><span class="sh">'</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">4</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="n">phone_number</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">4</span><span class="p">:]</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<ol>
  <li>다른 방식으로 풀이하여 통과하였습니다.</li>
</ol>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 2016년</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/24/python_ct1.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 2016년" /><published>2021-12-24T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2021-12-24T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/24/python_ct1</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/24/python_ct1.html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-24-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이">풀이</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="kn">import</span> <span class="n">datetime</span>
<span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="n">answer</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="p">[</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">MON</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">TUE</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">WED</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">THU</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">FRI</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">SAT</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="s">SUN</span><span class="sh">'</span><span class="p">]</span>    
    
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">answer</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">datetime</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">date</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">2016</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="nf">weekday</span><span class="p">()]</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<ol>
  <li>날짜 관련 모듈을 찾아보고 간단하게 작성했습니다!</li>
</ol>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 완주하지 못한 선수</title><link href="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/19/python_ct1.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="프로그래머스 Lv.1| Python - 완주하지 못한 선수" /><published>2021-12-19T00:00:00+09:00</published><updated>2021-12-19T00:00:00+09:00</updated><id>http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/19/python_ct1</id><content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost:4000/codingtest/2021/12/19/python_ct1.html"><![CDATA[<p><img src="/assets/images/post/2021/2021-12-19-pg1.png" alt="pg" /></p>

<h2 id="풀이">풀이</h2>
<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">solution</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">completion</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="n">answer</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="sh">''</span>
    
    <span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">sort</span><span class="p">()</span>
    <span class="n">completion</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">sort</span><span class="p">()</span>
    
    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="nf">range</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">completion</span><span class="p">)):</span>
        <span class="nf">if </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">!=</span> <span class="n">completion</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]):</span>
            <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span>

    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="nf">len</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">participant</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">]</span> 
</code></pre></div></div>]]></content><author><name>Lisa</name></author><category term="codingtest" /><category term="Python" /><category term="Programmers" /><category term="codingtest" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry></feed>